#: ../../technical/articles/160-ledger-review-imports-rules-inventory-and-read-surfaces.md:47
msgid ""
"_ledger_import_cli.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/entrypoints/cli/_ledger_import_cli.py`)"
msgstr ""
